{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01MtQZozS5sKWMPG3Ej8zdi9","type":"tool_result","content":"src/lookup3.rs:18:pub fn hashsize(n: usize) -> usize {\nsrc/lookup3.rs:23:pub fn hashmask(n: usize) -> usize {\nsrc/lookup3.rs:24:    hashsize(n) - 1\nc_src/src/lookup3.h:76:#define hashsize(n) ((size_t)1<<(n))\nc_src/src/lookup3.h:77:#define hashmask(n) (hashsize(n)-1)\nc_src/src/lookup3.h:183:  h = (h & hashmask(10));\nc_src/src/lookup3.h:184:In which case, the hash table should have hashsize(10) elements.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01C4ayQA9ifV3u3997GFA6vW","session_id":"e94907f6-9286-4b26-9780-21e7bb4d5fee","uuid":"05155ec8-5545-4841-a8ef-0a0fe2290d88","timestamp":"2026-08-22T14:33:35.059Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Verify remaining translated modules"}
